  "source": "Choreoform authoring \"0.19.0\" .\nProcess \"Terminal example\" .\nStart at \"Done\" .\nInputs empty .\nOutputs empty .\nOutcomes [ \"complete\" ] .\nUse cancellation \"Stop\" , faults \"Fault handling\" , closure \"Close\" and races \"Commit order\" .\nRequire actor \"Reviewer\" under \"Reviewer requirement\" .\nRule for actor \"Reviewer requirement\" .\nPermit when ( true ) .\nEnd policy .\nRule for cancel \"Stop\" .\nAuthority \"Reviewer\" .\nFor children use \"Settle\" .\nEnd policy .\nRule for settlement \"Settle\" .\nUnfinished work cancel .\nEnd policy .\nRule for faults \"Fault handling\" .\nHandle empty .\nEnd policy .\nRule for closure \"Close\" .\nFully terminal .\nEnd policy .\nRule for race \"Commit order\" .\nAccept in acceptance order .\nEnd policy .\nStep \"Done\" .\nFinish as \"complete\" .\nEnd step .\nRule for protection \"Access\" .\nPermit access when ( true ) .\nEnd policy .\nKeep \"Value\" as whole number , protected as \"Shared protection\" .\nInvalidate empty .\nInitially unavailable .\nEnd data .\nProtect data as \"Shared protection\" .\nUnder \"Access\" .\nSensitivity \"test\" .\nPurposes [ \"Use\" ] .\nParticipants [ \"Reviewer\" ] .\nCapabilities empty .\nEnd protection .\nLet \"Read condition\" mean ( test \"Same\" using [ \"Value\" is ( the value of \"Value\" ) ] ) as truth value with parameters empty .\nDefine test \"Same\" with inputs [ \"Value\" as whole number ] .\nIt holds when ( ( the parameter \"Value\" ) equals ( the parameter \"Value\" ) ) .\nEnd test .\nLet \"Opaque example\" mean ( \"Same\" ) as text with parameters empty .\nDescribe type \"Counter\" as whole number .\nEnd process .\n",
